    "_X5_note": "BODY tests are the template proving itself. Before any downstream file copies a pattern, the demo-test form has already verified that every pattern works. Trust is not assumed — it is earned through exhaustive verification. The 9 subsections (B9-B17) are the 9 witnesses that the template's promises are kept.",
    "_X5_scripture": "1 Thessalonians 5:21 — Prove all things; hold fast that which is good."
